Tests end-to-end understanding of an AWS-based AI data flow, including extraction, NLP, storage, and indexing, plus privacy and cost controls.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven design with S3, Lambda, Textract, Comprehend, DynamoDB
- IAM least privilege and KMS encryption
- Observability: DLQ, retries, CloudWatch
- Data governance: PII detection, versioning guidance

## Code Example
