## Cost & Privacy Controls

- **Batch processing** for Comprehend/Translate to reduce API calls
- **SageMaker serverless** endpoints for cost optimization
- **VPC endpoints** for private connectivity
- **KMS encryption** for S3 and DynamoDB
- **Data retention policies** and lifecycle management

## Monitoring

- **CloudWatch Metrics**: Success/failure rates, latency, token usage
- **X-Ray**: End-to-end tracing across services
- **EventBridge**: Failed execution notifications and auto-retries
- **Custom Dashboards**: Cost monitoring per conversation and service

